    pdftools
URL: https://github.com/MySimpleSmart/RAssistant
BugReports: https://github.com/MySimpleSmart/RAssistant/issues
Config/RAssistant/Changes: Separate Knowledge Base chat selection from deletion. Checkboxes save automatically; each file has its own Delete action instead of Remove selected.
    Confirm the exact file before deleting its stored copy. Keep the original file, chat selections for other documents and unsaved instructions when cancelling.
